                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَوَّنَهُ عَلَيْهِ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>He</i> (God) <i>made it easy and light
to him.</i> (K, * TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَوِّنِى الأَمْرَ وَلاَ تَحْزَنِيى لَهُ</span>
[<i>Make thou the case,</i> or <i>affair, light,</i> or <i>easy;</i>
i. e., <i>regard it lightly; and do not grieve for it</i>].
(TA, art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خفض</span>.)

